  qualification_note: "Intake workflow phases 1-5 within the return window; random-sample selection from the seller manifest, never seller-picked units. REFERENCE RE-BASED 2026-08-30 on the executed 20-unit purchase at 1,700 pre-tax plus 75 observed freight; wanted_units holds the 1-unit remainder of the original 21",
  refusal_conditions: ["seller will not palletize or quote freight", "quantity claimed but not verifiable at purchase time"],
}

